{# =========================================================
   ROOMHIVE — LISTING DETAIL (matched to the approved design)
   templates/listings/detail.html.twig

   CSS: public/assets/listing-detail.css (REWRITE — load with
   ?v=3 so browsers drop the old cached file):

       <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/listing-detail.css') }}?v=3">

   === WHAT CHANGED VS THE PREVIOUS VERSION (design shot) ===
   1. HEAD: Fraunces added to the Google Fonts link (section
      headings / listing title are serif in the design).
   2. Application-status pill MOVED OUT of the booking card —
      it now renders in the LEFT column, right under the
      location/reviews subline.
   3. Amenities: no card, no "What this place offers" heading —
      a flat gold-icon strip between two hairlines.
   4. House Rules MOVED from the sidebar to the LEFT column,
      directly under About (flat heading + text).
   5. Host: heading sits above a white card; card gains a
      "View Host Profile" outline button and a "No reviews yet"
      fallback line + response-time line.
   6. Booking card: 3 summary lines (Monthly price / Rental
      duration / Total rent); duration picker shows the number over the unit
      word (JS splits the label into #rd-dur-num / #rd-dur-word);
      charge note text matches the shot; "Capacity:" note
      removed from the card (capacity lives in Space Details).
   7. Space Details: heading is "Space details" with a gold bar
      to its right; rows show pluralized Bedroom/Bathroom,
      "sqm", "No" parking.
   8. Map note reads "Exact location shown on this map".
   9. The old CSS bound the sidebar styles to .rd-sidebar while
      this markup uses .rd-side — the new CSS targets BOTH, so
      no rename was needed here.
   10. "View Host Profile" now opens the host's PUBLIC profile
      — route app_host_public_profile → GET /listings/host/{id}
      (HostPublicProfileController renders listings/
      host_public_profile.html.twig) — instead of the old
      listings-grid placeholder. ListingsController already
      passes host.id, so no controller change was needed.
   11. BUGFIX — move-in date was being silently dropped. The
      #rd-movein input had id but no name, so the form
      (method=GET → /listings/{id}/payment) never carried
      ?checkin_date; PaymentController read empty, and
      ProcessPaymentController's `$checkin === ''` guard
      redirected back to app_listing_detail?incompletedates=1,
      showing "Please choose your move-in date before
      continuing" even though the user HAD picked a date. Fix:
      added name="checkin_date" to the #rd-movein input —
      flatpickr's onChange already kept its .value in sync, so
      no JS change is needed.
   12. WISHLIST HEART — the corner heart on the gallery photo and
       the topbar Save button are ONE wishlist toggle now: click
       either → red fill + pulsing glow (= saved, POSTs listing_id
       to the same /wishlist/toggle endpoint the My Wishlist page
       uses — {ok, added} and {ok, saved} response shapes both
       accepted) · click again → glow off (= removed). Initial
       state comes from the `wished` variable ListingsController
       feeds (SELECT on the legacy `wishlist` table). The old Save
       button only flipped a CSS class locally — nothing was ever
       saved; both controls persist for real now and stay in sync.
       Heart styles are page-local (the <style> block below) —
       listing-detail.css is untouched.
   13. ENQUIRY DATE GUARD — the Send Enquiry button could still
       be clicked with an empty Move-in date: the empty
       checkin_date travelled to the payment step and came back
       as the "Please choose your move-in date" redirect. The
       booking form now refuses to submit until a date is picked
       (long-term stays need one too — only the END date stays
       open). An empty submit is prevented, the date field
       flashes red + shakes, an inline message appears under it
       and the flatpickr calendar auto-opens; everything clears
       the moment a date is chosen. Error styles are page-local
       (the <style> block below) — listing-detail.css is
       untouched.
   14. VERIFICATION GATE — an unverified account can no longer
       send enquiries at all. "Verified" follows the legacy
       is_user_verified() rule: at least one 'verified' row in
       user_id_documents (Profile Settings promotes a pending ID
       upload to verified once the profile is complete). In the
       booking card the "Send Enquiry" submit button is REPLACED
       by a "Verify to Send Enquiry" button that goes to Profile
       Settings, with a lock note under it explaining why; a JS
       guard kills the only leftover submit path (Enter-key
       implicit submission) and shakes the verify nudge instead.
       Server side: PaymentController::choose bounces unverified
       renters (non-hosts, new-enquiry mode) back here with
       ?needverify=1 — the notice at the top of this page already
       renders it — and ProcessPaymentController does the same on
       the POST, so the UI lock cannot be walked around. Paying
       the REMAINING balance of an existing booking stays open,
       and hosts are exempt. Lock styles are page-local (the
       <style> block below) — listing-detail.css is untouched.
   15. RATINGS OVERLAY — the ★ "4.8 (12 reviews)" chip in the
       title subline is a real button now: clicking it opens a
       two-panel reviews modal (screenshot-matched). LEFT: the
       "How was your stay?" write panel — green "Stay completed"
       tag (amber-red "Stay cancelled" for a cancelled stay),
       listing · dates · host subline, big 5-star picker ("4 out
       of 5 — Good"), comment box, amber "Submit review" — shown
       ONLY when the viewer is logged in, not the host, holds a
       completed/cancelled booking on this listing and has not
       reviewed it yet (otherwise the reviews panel takes the
       full width; a viewer who already reviewed sees a "You
       rated this stay" box). RIGHT: the big average + count,
       5→1 star distribution bars, and every review card (avatar,
       name, date, stars, comment), newest first. Data comes
       from the new GET /listings/{id}/reviews-data endpoint
       (ListingReviewsController — install the new
       src/Controller/ListingReviewsController.php); submit POSTs
       the EXISTING /reviews/submit (booking_id · rating ·
       comment) with the same server-side guards (completed or
       cancelled only, one review per guest per listing — a
       double submit lands as a friendly 409 and the panel
       refreshes instead of erroring). The chip text stays in
       sync (#rd-rating-text): after a successful submit the
       average/count are refetched and the chip updates itself.
       All overlay styles + JS are page-local (below) —
       listing-detail.css is untouched. Dark mode, reduced
       motion and ≤760px stacking are handled.
========================================================= #}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>RoomHive - {{ listing.title }}</title>

        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/listing-detail.css') }}?v=3">

        <style>
            /* ============ wishlist heart — corner of the gallery
                                                   photo · red fill + pulsing glow when saved (.is-active)
                                                   · one-shot pop on every click (.is-popping).
                                                   Page-local on purpose: listing-detail.css stays as-is. */
            .rd-heart-btn {
                position: absolute;
                top: 14px;
                right: 14px;
                z-index: 4;
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.45);
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
                backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
                color: #ffffff;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.3);
                transition:
                    transform 0.18s ease,
                    background 0.2s ease;
            }
            .rd-heart-btn svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
            }
            .rd-heart-btn:hover {
                transform: scale(1.1);
            }
            .rd-heart-btn:active {
                transform: scale(0.9);
            }

            /* GLowing (saved) state — fill: currentColor overrides
                                                   lucide's fill="none" so the heart paints solid white. */
            .rd-heart-btn.is-active {
                background: #e5484d;
                animation: rd-heart-glow 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
            }
            .rd-heart-btn.is-active svg {
                fill: currentColor;
            }

            @keyframes rd-heart-glow {
                0%,
                100% {
                    box-shadow:
                        0 0 0 0 rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.3),
                        0 0 10px 2px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.45);
                }
                50% {
                    box-shadow:
                        0 0 0 6px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.12),
                        0 0 26px 8px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.65);
                }
            }

            /* one-shot pop on every click (the svg animates so the
                                                   glow loop on the button never restarts) */
            .rd-heart-btn.is-popping svg {
                animation: rd-heart-pop 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.6, 0.4, 1);
            }
            @keyframes rd-heart-pop {
                0% {
                    transform: scale(0.4);
                }
                55% {
                    transform: scale(1.35);
                }
                100% {
                    transform: scale(1);
                }
            }

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .rd-heart-btn,
                .rd-heart-btn svg {
                    transition: none;
                    animation: none;
                }
                .rd-heart-btn.is-active {
                    box-shadow: 0 0 16px 4px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.55);
                }
            }

            /* ============ ENQUIRY DATE GUARD — the Send Enquiry
                                                   form refuses to submit until a move-in date is
                                                   picked. Error styles are page-local on purpose so
                                                   listing-detail.css stays untouched: the date input
                                                   flashes red + shakes, an inline message shows under
                                                   it, and both clear the moment a date is chosen. */
            .rd-movein-input.rd-date-invalid {
                border-color: #e5484d;
                background: #fff5f5;
            }
            .rd-movein-input.rd-date-shake {
                animation: rd-date-shake 0.4s ease;
            }
            @keyframes rd-date-shake {
                0%,
                100% {
                    transform: translateX(0);
                }
                25% {
                    transform: translateX(-5px);
                }
                75% {
                    transform: translateX(5px);
                }
            }
            .rd-date-error {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 8px;
                margin: 8px 0 0;
                color: #c5343a;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 600;
                line-height: 1.45;
            }
            .rd-date-error svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
                flex: 0 0 auto;
                margin-top: 1px;
            }
            .rd-date-error[hidden] {
                display: none;
            }

            /* ============ VERIFICATION LOCK — when the account
                                                   is unverified the Send Enquiry CTA is replaced
                                                   by a "Verify to Send Enquiry" link with a lock
                                                   note under it, and the verify nudge can be
                                                   shaken by the JS guard. Page-local on purpose:
                                                   listing-detail.css stays untouched. */
            .rd-verify-lock-note {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 8px;
                margin: 10px 0 0;
                color: #6b7280;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 500;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }
            .rd-verify-lock-note svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
                flex: 0 0 auto;
                margin-top: 2px;
            }
            .rd-verify-lock-note a {
                color: #8a5a10;
                font-weight: 800;
                text-decoration: none;
            }
            .rd-verify-lock-note a:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }
            .rd-verify-nudge.rd-verify-shake {
                animation: rd-date-shake 0.4s ease;
            }

            /* ============ RATINGS OVERLAY — the ★ chip in the title
                                                   subline opens this modal: LEFT = "How was your
                                                   stay?" write panel (only for a completed /
                                                   cancelled stay of the viewer that is not yet
                                                   reviewed), RIGHT = big average + star
                                                   distribution bars + every review card. Data:
                                                   GET /listings/{id}/reviews-data · Submit: POST
                                                   /reviews/submit. Page-local on purpose:
                                                   listing-detail.css stays untouched. */
            .rd-rating-btn {
                background: none;
                border: 0;
                padding: 0;
                font: inherit;
                color: inherit;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 4px;
                cursor: pointer;
                border-radius: 6px;
            }
            .rd-rating-btn:hover #rd-rating-text {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }
            .rd-rating-btn:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }

            .rd-review-overlay {
                position: fixed;
                inset: 0;
                z-index: 3000;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 24px;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
                backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
                opacity: 0;
                visibility: hidden;
                transition: opacity 0.22s ease, visibility 0.22s ease;
            }
            .rd-review-overlay.is-open {
                opacity: 1;
                visibility: visible;
            }
            .rd-review-modal {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 940px;
                max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
                overflow-y: auto;
                background: #fff;
                border: 1px solid #EEF1F6;
                border-radius: 18px;
                box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
                transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.97);
                transition: transform 0.26s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.2, 0.4, 1);
            }
            .rd-review-overlay.is-open .rd-review-modal {
                transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
            }
            .rd-review-close {
                position: absolute;
                top: 14px;
                right: 14px;
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                background: transparent;
                color: #8B93A6;
                transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
            }
            .rd-review-close svg {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
            }
            .rd-review-close:hover {
                background: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08);
                color: #14142B;
                transform: rotate(90deg);
            }

            .rd-review-cols {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;
            }
            .rd-review-modal.no-write .rd-review-cols {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            /* hidden state — class-based so the markup never needs
               bracket selectors; JS toggles setHidden(el, v) which
               flips both the attribute and this class. */
            .is-rh-hidden {
                display: none !important;
            }

            /* ---- LEFT: write panel ("How was your stay?") ---- */
            .rd-review-write {
                padding: 26px 24px 24px;
                border-right: 1px solid #EEF1F6;
                background: #FBFCFE;
                border-radius: 18px 0 0 18px;
            }
            .rd-review-donebox {
                padding: 26px 24px 24px;
                border-right: 1px solid #EEF1F6;
                background: #FBFCFE;
                border-radius: 18px 0 0 18px;
                text-align: center;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .rd-review-tag {
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 4px 10px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.3px;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
                background: #E5F6EB;
                color: #1E7A3D;
            }
            .rd-review-tag.is-cancelled {
                background: #FCEAEA;
                color: #B44343;
            }
            .rd-review-wtitle {
                font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
                font-size: 22px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #14142B;
                margin: 0 0 6px;
            }
            .rd-review-wsub {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #8B93A6;
                line-height: 1.55;
                margin: 0 0 16px;
            }
            .rd-review-stars {
                display: flex;
                gap: 6px;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            .rd-star {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
                padding: 0;
                border: 0;
                background: none;
                cursor: pointer;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .rd-star svg {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                fill: #EEF1F6;
                stroke: #C9CFDB;
                stroke-width: 1.6;
                transition: fill 0.12s ease, stroke 0.12s ease, transform 0.12s ease;
            }
            .rd-star:hover svg {
                transform: scale(1.08);
            }
            .rd-star.is-lit svg {
                fill: #eda423;
                stroke: #d78f12;
            }
            .rd-review-star-label {
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #8B93A6;
                margin: 0 0 14px;
            }
            .rd-review-star-label.has-value {
                color: #b97f0e;
            }
            .rd-review-comment {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 110px;
                resize: vertical;
                border: 1px solid #E3E6EE;
                border-radius: 10px;
                background: #fff;
                padding: 10px 12px;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                color: #14142B;
                outline: none;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }
            .rd-review-comment:focus {
                border-color: #eda423;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15);
            }
            .rd-review-submit {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 11px 16px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 10px;
                cursor: pointer;
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6c04e, #eda423);
                color: #1c2a38;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                transition: filter 0.15s ease, transform 0.05s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
            }
            .rd-review-submit:hover {
                filter: brightness(1.05);
            }
            .rd-review-submit:active {
                transform: translateY(1px);
            }
            .rd-review-submit:disabled {
                opacity: 0.45;
                cursor: not-allowed;
            }
            .rd-review-error {
                color: #E14B4B;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
                margin: 10px 0 0;
            }
            .rd-review-donebox svg {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                color: #1E7A3D;
            }
            .rd-review-donebox h4 {
                font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: #14142B;
                margin: 0;
            }
            .rd-review-donebox p {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #8B93A6;
                margin: 0;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            /* ---- RIGHT: read panel (summary + cards) ---- */
            .rd-review-read {
                padding: 26px 26px 24px;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .rd-review-loading {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 10px;
                padding: 60px 20px;
                color: #8B93A6;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            .rd-review-spinner {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                border: 2.5px solid #EEF1F6;
                border-top-color: #eda423;
                animation: rd-review-spin 0.8s linear infinite;
            }
            @keyframes rd-review-spin {
                to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
            }
            .rd-review-score {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 14px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }
            .rd-review-avg {
                font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
                font-size: 44px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #14142B;
                line-height: 1;
            }
            .rd-review-score-side {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .rd-review-count {
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #14142B;
                margin: 4px 0 8px;
            }
            .rd-review-dist {
                display: grid;
                gap: 4px;
            }
            .rd-review-dist-row {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr 22px;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                color: #5d6875;
            }
            .rd-review-bar {
                height: 7px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: #F1F3F7;
                overflow: hidden;
            }
            .rd-review-bar span {
                display: block;
                height: 100%;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: #eda423;
                transition: width 0.4s ease;
            }
            .rd-review-bar-num {
                text-align: right;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #14142B;
            }
            .rd-review-list {
                display: grid;
            }
            .rd-review-card {
                padding: 14px 0;
                border-top: 1px solid #EEF1F6;
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
                gap: 12px;
            }
            .rd-review-card:first-child {
                border-top: 0;
            }
            .rd-review-avatar {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                object-fit: cover;
                background: #F1F3F7;
            }
            .rd-review-who {
                display: flex;
                align-items: baseline;
                gap: 8px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .rd-review-name {
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #14142B;
            }
            .rd-review-date {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #9AA2B1;
            }
            .rd-review-mini {
                display: inline-flex;
                gap: 2px;
                margin: 6px 0 4px;
            }
            .rd-review-mini svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                fill: #EEF1F6;
                stroke: #C9CFDB;
                stroke-width: 1.6;
            }
            .rd-review-mini span.is-lit svg {
                fill: #eda423;
                stroke: #d78f12;
            }
            .rd-review-text {
                font-size: 13.5px;
                color: #3d4653;
                line-height: 1.6;
                margin: 0;
            }
            .rd-review-empty {
                padding: 40px 10px;
                text-align: center;
                color: #8B93A6;
                font-size: 13.5px;
            }

            /* ---- dark mode (same tokens the booking page uses) ---- */
            html.dark .rd-review-overlay {
                background: rgba(4, 8, 14, 0.66);
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-modal {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-write,
            html.dark .rd-review-donebox {
                background: #161d24;
                border-right-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-wtitle,
            html.dark .rd-review-avg,
            html.dark .rd-review-name,
            html.dark .rd-review-count,
            html.dark .rd-review-bar-num,
            html.dark .rd-review-donebox h4 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-wsub,
            html.dark .rd-review-date,
            html.dark .rd-review-star-label,
            html.dark .rd-review-donebox p,
            html.dark .rd-review-empty,
            html.dark .rd-review-loading {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-star-label.has-value {
                color: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .rd-star svg,
            html.dark .rd-review-mini svg {
                fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
                stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
            }
            html.dark .rd-star.is-lit svg,
            html.dark .rd-review-mini span.is-lit svg {
                fill: #eda423;
                stroke: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-comment {
                background: #12181f;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-card {
                border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-avatar {
                background: #12181f;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-text {
                color: #c8d3df;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-bar {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-close {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .rd-review-close:hover {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .rd-review-overlay,
                .rd-review-modal,
                .rd-star svg,
                .rd-review-bar span {
                    transition: none;
                }
                .rd-review-spinner {
                    animation-duration: 1.6s;
                }
            }

            @media (max-width: 760px) {
                .rd-review-overlay {
                    padding: 10px;
                }
                .rd-review-modal {
                    max-height: calc(100vh - 20px);
                }
                .rd-review-cols,
                .rd-review-modal.no-write .rd-review-cols {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
                .rd-review-write,
                .rd-review-donebox {
                    border-right: 0;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF1F6;
                    border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;
                }
                .rd-review-read {
                    padding: 20px 18px;
                }
            }
        </style>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/flatpickr/dist/flatpickr.min.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css">

        <script>
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>
    </head>

    <body>

        <main class="listing-detail-page">

            <div class="rd-topbar">
                <a href="{{ path('app_listings') }}" class="rd-back-link">
                    <i data-lucide="arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Back to Listings
                </a>
                <div class="rd-topbar-actions">
                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="rd-action-btn{{ wished ? ' active' : '' }}"
                        id="rd-save-btn"
                    >
                        <i data-lucide="heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span class="rd-save-label">{{ wished ? 'Saved' : 'Save' }}</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="rd-action-btn" id="rd-share-btn">
                        <i data-lucide="share-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span class="rd-share-label">Share</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            {# ---------- REDIRECT NOTICES ---------- #}
            {% if flags.needverify %}
                <div class="rd-notice">
                    <i data-lucide="lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>Your enquiry wasn't sent — verify your identity in your
                        <a href="{{ path('app_profile_edit') }}#verify-card" style="font-weight:800; color:#8a5a10; text-decoration:none;">Edit Profile</a> page first.
                    </span>
                </div>
            {% elseif flags.unavailable %}
                <div class="rd-notice">
                    <i data-lucide="triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>Sorry, this space was just booked by someone else. Browse other available spaces below.</span>
                </div>
            {% elseif flags.ownbooking %}
                <div class="rd-notice">
                    <i data-lucide="info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>You can't book your own listing.</span>
                </div>
            {% elseif flags.alreadylisted %}
                <div class="rd-notice rd-notice-success">
                    <i data-lucide="circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>This space is already listed. It's live and visible to renters.</span>
                </div>
            {% elseif flags.incompletedates %}
                <div class="rd-notice">
                    <i data-lucide="triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>Please choose your move-in date before continuing.</span>
                </div>
            {% elseif flags.oneactive %}
                <div class="rd-notice">
                    <i data-lucide="info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span>Your enquiry wasn't sent: you already have an active booking request. You can only have one at a time; wait for the host's decision or cancel it from
                        <a href="{{ path('app_payments') }}" style="font-weight:800; color:#8a5a10; text-decoration:none;">My Bookings</a> first.
                    </span>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="rd-layout">

                {# ================= LEFT COLUMN ================= #}
                <div class="rd-main">

                    {# ---------- GALLERY ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-gallery rd-reveal" style="--d: .1s;">
                        <div class="rd-gallery-main">
                            <img src="{{ asset(listing.gallery[0]) }}" alt="{{ listing.title }}" id="rd-gallery-image">
                            {% if listing.gallery|length > 1 %}
                                <button type="button" class="rd-gallery-arrow rd-gallery-prev" id="rd-gallery-prev" aria-label="Previous image">
                                    <i data-lucide="chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="rd-gallery-arrow rd-gallery-next" id="rd-gallery-next" aria-label="Next image">
                                    <i data-lucide="chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </button>
                            {% endif %}
                            <span class="rd-gallery-count" id="rd-gallery-count">1 / {{ listing.gallery|length }}</span>
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                id="rd-heart-btn"
                                class="rd-heart-btn{{ wished ? ' is-active' : '' }}"
                                aria-pressed="{{ wished ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
                                aria-label="{{ wished ? 'Remove from wishlist' : 'Save to wishlist' }}"
                                title="{{ wished ? 'Remove from wishlist' : 'Save to wishlist' }}"
                            >
                                <i data-lucide="heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        {% if listing.gallery|length > 1 %}
                            <div class="rd-gallery-thumbs-wrap">
                                <button type="button" class="rd-thumbs-arrow rd-thumbs-prev" id="rd-thumbs-prev" aria-label="Scroll thumbnails left">
                                    <i data-lucide="chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </button>
                                <div class="rd-gallery-thumbs" id="rd-gallery-thumbs">
                                    {% for image in listing.gallery %}
                                        <img
                                            src="{{ asset(image) }}"
                                            alt="Thumbnail {{ loop.index }}"
                                            class="rd-thumb {{ loop.first ? 'active' : '' }}"
                                            data-index="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                                        >
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </div>
                                <button type="button" class="rd-thumbs-arrow rd-thumbs-next" id="rd-thumbs-next" aria-label="Scroll thumbnails right">
                                    <i data-lucide="chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    {# ---------- TITLE / RATING ---------- #}
                    <h1 class="rd-title rd-reveal" style="--d: .15s;">{{ listing.title }}</h1>

                    <div class="rd-subline rd-reveal" style="--d: .18s;">
                        <span class="rd-location">
                            <i data-lucide="map-pin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ listing.location_full }}
                        </span>
                        {# RATINGS OVERLAY OPENER — the chip is a real button now:
                           click opens the two-panel reviews modal (styles + JS at
                           the bottom of this file). #rd-rating-text keeps the
                           label so the JS can sync it after a fresh review. #}
                        <button type="button" class="rd-rating rd-rating-btn" id="rd-rating-open" aria-haspopup="dialog" title="{% if listing.reviews > 0 %}See all reviews{% else %}Be the first to review{% endif %}">
                            <i data-lucide="star" class="rd-star-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span id="rd-rating-text">{% if listing.reviews > 0 %}{{ listing.rating|number_format(1) }} ({{ listing.reviews }} reviews){% else %}Be the first to review{% endif %}</span>
                        </button>
                        {% if listing.is_new %}
                            <span class="rd-badge rd-badge-new">New</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    {# ---------- APPLICATION STATUS (left column, under the subline) ---------- #}
                    {% if my_application_status %}
                        <span class="rd-application-status rd-application-status-{{ my_application_status }} rd-reveal" style="--d: .2s;">
                            Application {{ my_application_status|title }}
                        </span>
                    {% endif %}

                    {# ---------- AMENITIES (flat strip — no card, no heading) ---------- #}
                    {% if listing.amenities|length > 0 or listing.has_parking %}
                        <div class="rd-amenities rd-reveal" style="--d: .26s;">
                            <div class="rd-amenity-grid">
                                {% for key in listing.amenities %}
                                    <div class="rd-amenity">
                                        <i data-lucide="{{ amenity_icons[key] ?? 'circle-check' }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>{{ amenity_options[key] ?? key|replace({'-': ' '})|title }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                {% endfor %}
                                {% if listing.has_parking and 'parking' not in listing.amenities %}
                                    <div class="rd-amenity">
                                        <i data-lucide="square-parking" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>Parking</span>
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    {# ---------- ABOUT ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-section rd-about rd-reveal" style="--d: .3s;">
                        <h2 class="rd-section-title">About this space</h2>
                        {% if listing.description %}
                            <p class="rd-about-text" id="rd-about-text">{{ listing.description }}</p>
                            {% if listing.description|length > 220 %}
                                <button type="button" class="rd-show-more" id="rd-show-more">
                                    Show more <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="rd-show-more-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                </button>
                            {% endif %}
                        {% else %}
                            <p class="rd-about-text">The host hasn't added a description yet — check the details and photos below.</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    {# ---------- HOUSE RULES (left column, under About) ---------- #}
                    {% if listing.house_rules %}
                        <div class="rd-section rd-rules rd-reveal" style="--d: .32s;">
                            <h2 class="rd-section-title">House Rules</h2>
                            <p class="rd-rules-text">{{ listing.house_rules }}</p>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    {# ---------- HOST ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-section rd-host rd-reveal" style="--d: .34s;">
                        <h2 class="rd-section-title">Meet your host</h2>
                        <div class="rd-host-card">
                            <div class="rd-host-row">
                                <img class="rd-host-avatar" src="{{ asset(host.avatar) }}" alt="{{ host.name }}">
                                <div class="rd-host-info">
                                    <strong>{{ host.name }}</strong>
                                    {% if host.reviews > 0 %}
                                        <span class="rd-rating">
                                            <i data-lucide="star" class="rd-star-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                            {{ host.rating|number_format(1) }} ({{ host.reviews }} reviews)
                                        </span>
                                    {% else %}
                                        <span>No reviews yet</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <span>Member since {{ host.member_since }}</span>
                                    <span>Response time: within a day</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <a href="{{ path('app_host_public_profile', { id: host.id }) }}" class="rd-host-profile-btn">View Host Profile</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {# ---------- MAP / WHERE YOU'LL BE ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-section rd-location-card rd-reveal" style="--d: .38s;">
                        <h2 class="rd-section-title">Where you'll be</h2>
                        <p class="rd-where-address">{{ listing.location_full }}</p>
                        <div class="rd-map-embed" id="rd-map"></div>
                        {% if has_pin %}
                            <p class="rd-map-exact-note">
                                <i data-lucide="circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Exact location shown on this map
                            </p>
                        {% endif %}
                        <a class="rd-btn rd-btn-outline" href="{{ maps_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                            Open in Google Maps
                        </a>
                    </div>

                </div>

                {# ================= SIDEBAR ================= #}
                <aside class="rd-side">

                    {# ---------- BOOKING CARD ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-booking-card rd-card rd-reveal" style="--d: .22s;">

                        <div class="rd-price-row">
                            <i data-lucide="philippine-peso" class="rd-peso-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span class="rd-price"><span class="rd-peso" id="rd-price-display">{{ listing.price|number_format(0) }}</span></span>
                            <span class="rd-per">/ month</span>
                        </div>

                        {% if not is_bookable %}
                            <div class="rd-unavailable-note">
                                <i data-lucide="circle-x" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>
                                    {% if is_long_term_occupied %}
                                        This space is currently occupied on a long-term stay and isn't accepting new bookings.
                                    {% else %}
                                        This space isn't available for booking right now.
                                    {% endif %}
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% if show_verify_nudge %}
                            <div class="rd-verify-nudge">
                                <i data-lucide="shield-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>
                                    Verify your identity to send enquiries —
                                    <a href="{{ path('app_profile_edit') }}#verify-card">verify now</a>.
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% if is_own_listing %}
                            <div class="rd-unavailable-note">
                                <i data-lucide="info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>This is your listing — you can't book your own space.</span>
                            </div>
                        {% elseif is_logged_in and my_application_status in ['pending', 'confirmed'] %}
                            {# THE RENTER'S OWN BOOKING CARD - the listing
                               disappears for the tenant who booked it: no
                               form here, just their status + a link to My
                               Bookings. Everyone else still sees the normal
                               form with the booked dates disabled. #}
                            <div class="rd-unavailable-note">
                                <i data-lucide="{{ my_application_status == 'confirmed' ? 'circle-check' : 'clock' }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>
                                    {% if my_application_status == 'confirmed' %}
                                        You've booked this space - your stay is confirmed. Manage it from
                                        <a href="{{ path('app_payments') }}" style="font-weight:800; color:#8a5a10; text-decoration:none;">My Bookings</a>.
                                    {% else %}
                                        Your booking request is waiting for the host's decision. Track it from
                                        <a href="{{ path('app_payments') }}" style="font-weight:800; color:#8a5a10; text-decoration:none;">My Bookings</a>.
                                    {% endif %}
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        {% elseif is_bookable and is_logged_in %}

                            <form
                                class="rd-booking-form"
                                id="rd-booking-form"
                                method="GET"
                                action="{{ path('app_listing_payment', { id: listing.id }) }}"
                                data-verify-required="{{ show_verify_nudge ? '1' : '0' }}"
                            >

                                <input type="hidden" name="listing_id" value="{{ listing.id }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="guests" value="{{ guests_value }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="checkout_date" id="rd-checkout-hidden" value="">
                                <input type="hidden" name="months" id="rd-months-hidden" value="{{ listing.duration_months }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="long_term" id="rd-longterm-hidden" value="0">

                                {# ---- SUMMARY LINES ---- #}
                                <div class="rd-price-rows">
                                    <div class="rd-price-line">
                                        <span>Monthly price</span>
                                        <strong>&#8369; <span id="rd-row-monthly">{{ listing.price|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</span></strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rd-price-line">
                                        <span>Rental duration</span>
                                        <strong id="rd-row-dur">{{ listing.duration_label }}</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rd-price-line rd-line-total">
                                        <span>Total rent (<span id="rd-row-duration">{{ listing.duration_label }}</span>)</span>
                                        <strong>&#8369; <span id="rd-row-total">{{ listing.total_rent|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</span></strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rd-price-line">
                                        <span>Due today</span>
                                        <strong>&#8369; <span id="rd-row-due">{{ listing.total_rent|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}</span></strong>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <label class="rd-field-label" for="rd-movein">
                                    <i data-lucide="calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i> Move-in date
                                </label>
                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    class="rd-movein-input"
                                    id="rd-movein"
                                    name="checkin_date"
                                    placeholder="Select your move-in date"
                                    aria-describedby="rd-date-error"
                                    aria-required="true"
                                    readonly
                                >

                                <p class="rd-date-error" id="rd-date-error" hidden>
                                    <i data-lucide="triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    <span>Please choose your move-in date before sending your enquiry.</span>
                                </p>

                                <div id="rd-duration-wrap">
                                    <label class="rd-field-label">
                                        <i data-lucide="calendar-range" aria-hidden="true"></i> Rental duration
                                    </label>
                                    <div class="rd-duration-picker">
                                        <button type="button" class="rd-dur-btn rd-dur-minus" id="rd-dur-minus" aria-label="Shorter duration">&minus;</button>
                                        <div class="rd-dur-value">
                                            <strong id="rd-dur-num">{{ listing.duration_months }}</strong>
                                            <span id="rd-dur-word">{{ listing.duration_months == 1 ? 'Month' : 'Months' }}</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <button type="button" class="rd-dur-btn rd-dur-plus" id="rd-dur-plus" aria-label="Longer duration">+</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="rd-long-term">
                                    <label class="rd-long-term-label">
                                        <input type="checkbox" id="rd-long-term">
                                        <i data-lucide="infinity" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>Long term stay (open-ended, month-to-month)</span>
                                    </label>
                                </div>

                                {% if show_verify_nudge %}
                                    {# VERIFICATION LOCK — no submit button is
                                       rendered at all while the account is
                                       unverified: this link replaces the CTA and
                                       takes the renter to Profile Settings, and
                                       the JS guard below kills the Enter-key
                                       submit path. The server gates (needverify)
                                       back the page up. #}
                                    <a
                                        href="{{ path('app_profile_edit') }}#verify-card"
                                        class="rd-btn rd-btn-primary rd-enquiry-locked"
                                        id="rd-enquiry-locked-btn"
                                        style="margin-top:16px;"
                                    >
                                        <i data-lucide="shield-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        Verify to Send Enquiry
                                    </a>

                                    <p class="rd-verify-lock-note">
                                        <i data-lucide="lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>
                                            Sending enquiries needs a verified account.
                                            Verify your identity on the
                                            <a href="{{ path('app_profile_edit') }}#verify-card">Edit Profile page</a>,
                                            then come back and book this space.
                                        </span>
                                    </p>
                                {% else %}
                                    <button type="submit" class="rd-btn rd-btn-primary" id="rd-enquiry-btn">
                                        <i data-lucide="send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Send Enquiry
                                    </button>

                                    <p class="rd-charge-note">
                                        <i data-lucide="lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        <span>You won't be charged yet — pay the full amount on the next page to confirm your booking.</span>
                                    </p>
                                {% endif %}
                            </form>

                        {% elseif is_bookable and not is_logged_in %}
                            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="rd-btn rd-btn-primary" style="margin-top:16px;">
                                <i data-lucide="log-in" aria-hidden="true"></i> Log in to book
                            </a>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    {# ---------- SPACE DETAILS ---------- #}
                    <div class="rd-details-card rd-card rd-reveal" style="--d: .26s;">
                        <h3><i data-lucide="info" aria-hidden="true"></i> Space details</h3>

                        {% if listing.category_label ?? true %}
                            <div class="rd-detail-row">
                                <i data-lucide="home" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>Space type</span>
                                <strong>{{ (listing.category_label ?? 'entire-house')|replace({'-': ' '}) }}</strong>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="bed-double" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Bedrooms</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.bedrooms }} Bedroom{{ listing.bedrooms == 1 ? '' : 's' }}</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="bath" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Bathrooms</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.bathrooms }} Bathroom{{ listing.bathrooms == 1 ? '' : 's' }}</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="ruler" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Size</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.size_sqm ? listing.size_sqm|number_format(0) ~ ' sqm' : '—' }}</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="building-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Floor</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.floor ?: '—' }}</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Parking</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.has_parking ? listing.parking : 'No' }}</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-detail-row">
                            <i data-lucide="users" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>Capacity</span>
                            <strong>{{ listing.capacity_label }}</strong>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </aside>

            </div>

        </main>

        {% include 'partials/footer.html.twig' ignore missing %}

        <!-- ==============================================
             RATINGS OVERLAY — opens from the ★ chip in the
             title subline. LEFT: "How was your stay?" write
             panel (only when the viewer completed/cancelled a
             stay here and has not reviewed it yet). RIGHT:
             average + star distribution + all review cards.
             Data: GET /listings/{id}/reviews-data ·
             Submit: POST /reviews/submit (booking_id · rating
             · comment). X / backdrop / ESC all close it.
        =============================================== -->
        <div class="rd-review-overlay" id="rdReviewOverlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="rdRevTitle"
             data-listing-id="{{ listing.id }}"
             data-host="{{ host.name|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-title="{{ listing.title|e('html_attr') }}">
            <div class="rd-review-modal no-write" id="rdReviewModal">
                <button type="button" class="rd-review-close" id="rdReviewClose" aria-label="Close reviews" title="Close">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"/><path d="m6 6 12 12"/></svg>
                </button>

                <div class="rd-review-loading" id="rdReviewLoading">
                    <span class="rd-review-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span> Loading reviews…
                </div>

                <div class="rd-review-cols is-rh-hidden" id="rdReviewCols" hidden>
                    <section class="rd-review-write is-rh-hidden" id="rdReviewWrite" hidden>
                        <span class="rd-review-tag" id="rdReviewTag">Stay completed</span>
                        <h3 class="rd-review-wtitle" id="rdRevTitle">How was your stay?</h3>
                        <p class="rd-review-wsub" id="rdReviewWSub"></p>

                        <div class="rd-review-stars" id="rdReviewStars">
                            {% for i in 1..5 %}
                                <button type="button" class="rd-star" data-value="{{ i }}" aria-label="Rate {{ i }} star{{ i > 1 ? 's' : '' }}" title="{{ i }} star{{ i > 1 ? 's' : '' }}">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
                                </button>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                        <p class="rd-review-star-label" id="rdReviewStarLabel">Tap a star to rate</p>

                        <textarea class="rd-review-comment" id="rdReviewComment" maxlength="1000"
                                  placeholder="Tell others about your stay — what made it great, what could be better (optional)"></textarea>

                        <button type="button" class="rd-review-submit" id="rdReviewSubmit" disabled>Submit review</button>
                        <p class="rd-review-error" id="rdReviewError" hidden></p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="rd-review-donebox is-rh-hidden" id="rdReviewDoneBox" hidden>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
                        <h4 id="rdRevDoneTitle">Thanks for your review!</h4>
                        <p id="rdRevDoneMsg">Your rating is now on this listing and your Reviews page.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="rd-review-read">
                        <div class="rd-review-score">
                            <div class="rd-review-avg" id="rdReviewAvg">—</div>
                            <div class="rd-review-score-side">
                                <div class="rd-review-count" id="rdReviewCount">Reviews</div>
                                <div class="rd-review-dist is-rh-hidden" id="rdReviewDist" hidden></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-review-list" id="rdReviewList"></div>
                        <div class="rd-review-empty is-rh-hidden" id="rdReviewEmpty" hidden>No reviews yet — be the first to share how it went.</div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# ---------- PAGE DATA FOR JS ---------- #}
        <script type="application/json" id="rd-data">
        {{ {
            gallery:     listing.gallery,
            basePrice:   listing.price,
            unavailable: unavailable_ranges,
        }|json_encode(
            constant('JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE')
            b-or constant('JSON_HEX_TAG')
            b-or constant('JSON_HEX_AMP')
            b-or constant('JSON_HEX_APOS')
            b-or constant('JSON_HEX_QUOT')
        )|raw }}
    </script>

        <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.469.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
        <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/flatpickr"></script>
        <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>

        <script>
        (function () {
            "use strict";

            var DATA = JSON.parse(document.getElementById("rd-data").textContent);
            var BASE_PRICE = Number(DATA.basePrice) || 0;
            var MONTHS_MIN = 1, MONTHS_MAX = 12;
            var duration = {{ listing.duration_months }};
            var longTerm = false;

            function icons() {
                if (window.lucide && typeof lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                    lucide.createIcons();
                }
            }
            if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", icons);
            } else {
                icons();
            }

            function peso(n) {
                return Number(n).toLocaleString("en-PH", { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
            }

            /* ============ GALLERY ============ */
            var gIndex = 0;
            var gImg = document.getElementById("rd-gallery-image");
            var gCount = document.getElementById("rd-gallery-count");

            function showGallery(i) {
                if (!DATA.gallery.length) return;
                gIndex = (i + DATA.gallery.length) % DATA.gallery.length;
                gImg.src = DATA.gallery[gIndex];
                if (gCount) gCount.textContent = (gIndex + 1) + " / " + DATA.gallery.length;

                document.querySelectorAll(".rd-thumb").forEach(function (t, idx) {
                    t.classList.toggle("active", idx === gIndex);
                });
            }

            var prev = document.getElementById("rd-gallery-prev");
            var next = document.getElementById("rd-gallery-next");
            if (prev) prev.addEventListener("click", function () { showGallery(gIndex - 1); });
            if (next) next.addEventListener("click", function () { showGallery(gIndex + 1); });

            var thumbsWrap = document.getElementById("rd-gallery-thumbs");
            if (thumbsWrap) {
                thumbsWrap.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
                    var t = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest(".rd-thumb") : null;
                    if (t) showGallery(parseInt(t.dataset.index, 10) || 0);
                });
            }

            /* ============ PRICING / DURATION ============ */
            function computeCheckout(moveIn, months) {
                if (!moveIn) return "";
                var d = new Date(moveIn + "T00:00:00");
                d.setMonth(d.getMonth() + months);
                d.setDate(d.getDate() - 1);
                return d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
            }

            function updatePricing() {
                var durNum = document.getElementById("rd-dur-num");
                var durWord = document.getElementById("rd-dur-word");
                var rowDuration = document.getElementById("rd-row-duration");
                var rowDur = document.getElementById("rd-row-dur");
                var rowMonthly = document.getElementById("rd-row-monthly");
                var rowTotal = document.getElementById("rd-row-total");
                var rowDue = document.getElementById("rd-row-due");
                var monthsHidden = document.getElementById("rd-months-hidden");
                var longHidden = document.getElementById("rd-longterm-hidden");
                var checkoutHidden = document.getElementById("rd-checkout-hidden");

                var total = longTerm ? BASE_PRICE : BASE_PRICE * duration;

                var label = longTerm ? "Long Term" : (duration === 1 ? "1 Month" : duration + " Months");
                var num = longTerm ? "\u221E" : String(duration);
                var word = longTerm ? "Long Term" : (duration === 1 ? "Month" : "Months");

                if (durNum) durNum.textContent = num;
                if (durWord) durWord.textContent = word;
                if (rowDuration) rowDuration.textContent = label;
                if (rowDur) rowDur.textContent = label;
                if (rowMonthly) rowMonthly.textContent = peso(BASE_PRICE);
                if (rowTotal) rowTotal.textContent = peso(total);
                if (rowDue) rowDue.textContent = peso(total);
                if (monthsHidden) monthsHidden.value = String(longTerm ? 1 : duration);
                if (longHidden) longHidden.value = longTerm ? "1" : "0";

                var moveIn = document.getElementById("rd-movein");
                if (checkoutHidden) {
                    checkoutHidden.value = (longTerm || !moveIn) ? "" : computeCheckout(moveIn.value, duration);
                }
            }

            var minus = document.getElementById("rd-dur-minus");
            var plus = document.getElementById("rd-dur-plus");
            if (minus) minus.addEventListener("click", function () {
                if (duration > MONTHS_MIN) { duration--; updatePricing(); }
            });
            if (plus) plus.addEventListener("click", function () {
                if (duration < MONTHS_MAX) { duration++; updatePricing(); }
            });

            var ltCheckbox = document.getElementById("rd-long-term");
            var durationWrap = document.getElementById("rd-duration-wrap");
            if (ltCheckbox) {
                ltCheckbox.addEventListener("change", function () {
                    longTerm = ltCheckbox.checked;
                    if (durationWrap) {
                        durationWrap.classList.toggle("rd-date-hidden", longTerm);
                        durationWrap.style.display = ""; /* CSS owns the hidden state */
                    }
                    updatePricing();
                });
            }

            /* ============ MOVE-IN CALENDAR (flatpickr) ============ */
            var movein = document.getElementById("rd-movein");
            var fpCalendar = null;
            if (movein && window.flatpickr) {

                /* Booked ranges -> disabled dates. A range with no
                   end (long-term stay) blocks from its start onward. */
                var disabled = DATA.unavailable.map(function (r) {
                    if (r.start && r.end) return { from: r.start, to: r.end };
                    if (r.start) return { from: r.start, to: "9999-12-31" };
                    return null;
                }).filter(Boolean);

                fpCalendar = flatpickr(movein, {
                    minDate: "today",
                    dateFormat: "Y-m-d",
                    disable: disabled,
                    onChange: function () { clearDateError(); updatePricing(); }
                });
            }

            /* ============ ENQUIRY DATE GUARD — the Send Enquiry
               form refuses to submit until a move-in date is
               picked (long-term stays need one too — only the END
               date stays open). Without this the empty
               checkin_date travelled to the payment step and came
               back as the "Please choose your move-in date"
               redirect. On an empty submit: submission is
               prevented, the field flashes red + shakes, the
               inline message shows and the calendar auto-opens.
               Everything clears the moment a date is chosen. */
            var bookingForm = document.getElementById("rd-booking-form");
            var dateError = document.getElementById("rd-date-error");

            function showDateError() {
                if (movein) {
                    movein.classList.add("rd-date-invalid");
                    movein.setAttribute("aria-invalid", "true");
                    movein.classList.remove("rd-date-shake");
                    void movein.offsetWidth; /* restart the shake */
                    movein.classList.add("rd-date-shake");
                }
                if (dateError) {
                    dateError.hidden = false;
                }
                if (fpCalendar && typeof fpCalendar.open === "function") {
                    fpCalendar.open();
                }
            }

            function clearDateError() {
                if (movein) {
                    movein.classList.remove("rd-date-invalid", "rd-date-shake");
                    movein.removeAttribute("aria-invalid");
                }
                if (dateError) {
                    dateError.hidden = true;
                }
            }

            if (bookingForm) {
                bookingForm.addEventListener("submit", function (e) {
                    var mv = document.getElementById("rd-movein");
                    if (mv && !mv.value) {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        showDateError();
                    }
                });
            }

            /* ============ VERIFICATION GUARD — an unverified
               account cannot send enquiries. When the controller
               flags the viewer unverified, the submit button is
               already REPLACED by a "Verify to Send Enquiry" link
               (Profile Settings) in the markup above; this listener
               kills the one leftover path -- implicit submission
               via the Enter key -- and shakes the verify nudge so
               the reason is on screen. The server gates bounce any
               crafted request back with ?needverify=1. */
            if (bookingForm && bookingForm.getAttribute("data-verify-required") === "1") {
                bookingForm.addEventListener("submit", function (e) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    var nudge = document.querySelector(".rd-verify-nudge");
                    if (nudge) {
                        nudge.classList.remove("rd-verify-shake");
                        void nudge.offsetWidth; /* restart the shake */
                        nudge.classList.add("rd-verify-shake");
                        nudge.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "center" });
                    }
                });
            }

            updatePricing();

            /* ============ SHOW MORE (about) ============ */
            var showMore = document.getElementById("rd-show-more");
            var aboutText = document.getElementById("rd-about-text");
            if (showMore && aboutText) {
                showMore.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var expanded = aboutText.classList.toggle("expanded");
                    showMore.innerHTML = expanded
                        ? 'Show less <i data-lucide="chevron-up" class="rd-show-more-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>'
                        : 'Show more <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="rd-show-more-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>';
                    icons();
                });
            }

            /* ============ SAVE / WISHLIST HEART — one toggle, two
               controls. The corner heart (#rd-heart-btn) and the
               topbar Save button (#rd-save-btn) flip the SAME
               wishlist entry through the same /wishlist/toggle
               endpoint the My Wishlist page uses. Glow (red fill +
               halo) = saved, plain = not saved. Initial state comes
               from the `wished` variable the controller feeds.
               Optimistic UI: the glow flips instantly on click, then
               snaps to the server's answer (or reverts if not ok). */
            var heartBtn  = document.getElementById("rd-heart-btn");
            var saveBtn   = document.getElementById("rd-save-btn");
            var saveLabel = saveBtn ? saveBtn.querySelector(".rd-save-label") : null;
            var wishBusy  = false;

            function setWishUI(on) {
                if (heartBtn) {
                    heartBtn.classList.toggle("is-active", !!on);
                    heartBtn.setAttribute("aria-pressed", on ? "true" : "false");
                    heartBtn.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        on ? "Remove from wishlist" : "Save to wishlist"
                    );
                    heartBtn.title = on ? "Remove from wishlist" : "Save to wishlist";
                }
                if (saveBtn) {
                    saveBtn.classList.toggle("active", !!on);
                    if (saveLabel) {
                        saveLabel.textContent = on ? "Saved" : "Save";
                    }
                }
            }

            function heartPop() {
                if (!heartBtn) {
                    return;
                }
                heartBtn.classList.remove("is-popping");
                void heartBtn.offsetWidth; /* restart the pop animation */
                heartBtn.classList.add("is-popping");
                setTimeout(function () {
                    heartBtn.classList.remove("is-popping");
                }, 450);
            }

            function toggleWishlist() {
                if (wishBusy) {
                    return;
                }
                wishBusy = true;

                var wasOn = heartBtn
                    ? heartBtn.classList.contains("is-active")
                    : (saveBtn ? saveBtn.classList.contains("active") : false);

                /* optimistic glow first — the click must feel instant */
                setWishUI(!wasOn);
                heartPop();

                fetch("/wishlist/toggle", {
                    method: "POST",
                    headers: {
                        "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                    },
                    body: "listing_id=" + encodeURIComponent("{{ listing.id }}"),
                })
                    .then(function (r) {
                        return r.json();
                    })
                    .then(function (d) {
                        if (!d || !d.ok) {
                            /* guest (not logged in) / bad request — fall
                               back to the pre-click state */
                            setWishUI(wasOn);
                            return;
                        }
                        /* both controller shapes: {ok, added} and {ok, saved} */
                        var on = d.added !== undefined ? !!d.added : !!d.saved;
                        setWishUI(on);
                    })
                    .catch(function () {
                        /* network error — keep the visual toggle */
                    })
                    .then(function () {
                        wishBusy = false;
                    });
            }

            if (heartBtn) {
                heartBtn.addEventListener("click", toggleWishlist);
            }
            if (saveBtn) {
                saveBtn.addEventListener("click", toggleWishlist);
            }

            /* ============ SHARE ============ */
            var shareBtn = document.getElementById("rd-share-btn");
            if (shareBtn) {
                shareBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var url = window.location.href;
                    if (navigator.share) {
                        navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: url }).catch(function () {});
                    } else if (navigator.clipboard) {
                        navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
                        var label = shareBtn.querySelector(".rd-share-label");
                        if (label) {
                            var old = label.textContent;
                            label.textContent = "Copied!";
                            setTimeout(function () { label.textContent = old; }, 1500);
                        }
                    }
                });
            }

            /* ============ MAP (Leaflet, no API key) ============ */
            var mapEl = document.getElementById("rd-map");
            {% if has_pin %}
            if (mapEl && window.L) {
                var map = L.map(mapEl).setView([{{ maps_query }}], 15);
                L.tileLayer("https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png", {
                    attribution: "&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors"
                }).addTo(map);
                L.circleMarker([{{ maps_query }}], {
                    radius: 10,
                    color: "#eda423",
                    fillColor: "#f6c04e",
                    fillOpacity: 0.85
                }).addTo(map);
            }
            {% else %}
            if (mapEl) {
                mapEl.innerHTML =
                    '<div style="height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#5d6875;font-size:13px;">Approximate area — see address above</div>';
            }
            {% endif %}
        })();
    </script>

    <script>
        /* ============ RATINGS OVERLAY ============
           Click the ★ chip in the title subline → this modal.
           Fetches GET /listings/{id}/reviews-data once and
           renders the summary + cards; if the viewer may rate,
           the write panel lights up (booking_id comes from the
           payload). Submit POSTs the EXISTING /reviews/submit
           (booking_id · rating · comment) — the same endpoint
           the booking page's review box uses — then refetches
           so the average, count, distribution and the ★ chip
           itself all update without a page reload. */
        (function () {
            "use strict";

            var overlay = document.getElementById("rdReviewOverlay");
            var openBtn = document.getElementById("rd-rating-open");
            if (!overlay || !openBtn) return;

            var modal    = document.getElementById("rdReviewModal");
            var closeX   = document.getElementById("rdReviewClose");
            var loadEl   = document.getElementById("rdReviewLoading");
            var cols     = document.getElementById("rdReviewCols");

            var writeP   = document.getElementById("rdReviewWrite");
            var doneP    = document.getElementById("rdReviewDoneBox");
            var doneTtl  = document.getElementById("rdRevDoneTitle");
            var doneMsg  = document.getElementById("rdRevDoneMsg");
            var tagEl    = document.getElementById("rdReviewTag");
            var subEl    = document.getElementById("rdReviewWSub");
            var starWrap = document.getElementById("rdReviewStars");
            var starLbl  = document.getElementById("rdReviewStarLabel");
            var ta       = document.getElementById("rdReviewComment");
            var sendBtn  = document.getElementById("rdReviewSubmit");
            var errEl    = document.getElementById("rdReviewError");

            var avgEl   = document.getElementById("rdReviewAvg");
            var cntEl   = document.getElementById("rdReviewCount");
            var distEl  = document.getElementById("rdReviewDist");
            var listEl  = document.getElementById("rdReviewList");
            var emptyEl = document.getElementById("rdReviewEmpty");
            var chipTxt = document.getElementById("rd-rating-text");

            var HOST_NAME  = overlay.getAttribute("data-host")  || "your host";
            var LIST_TITLE = overlay.getAttribute("data-title") || "this listing";
            var ENDPOINT   = "/listings/" + overlay.getAttribute("data-listing-id") + "/reviews-data";

            var LABELS = { 1: "Poor", 2: "Fair", 3: "Okay", 4: "Good", 5: "Excellent" };
            var STAR = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>';

            var picked = 0, bookingId = 0, busy = false, loaded = false, isLoading = false;

            /* hidden state = attribute + class (the class does the
               display:none for the grid/flex panels) */
            function setHidden(el, v) {
                if (!el) { return; }
                el.hidden = !!v;
                el.classList.toggle("is-rh-hidden", !!v);
            }

            function esc(s) {
                return String(s == null ? "" : s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, function (c) {
                    return { "&": "&amp;", "<": "&lt;", ">": "&gt;", '"': "&quot;", "'": "&#39;" }[c];
                });
            }

            function miniStars(n) {
                var out = '<span class="rd-review-mini">';
                for (var i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
                    out += '<span class="' + (i <= n ? "is-lit" : "") + '">' + STAR + "</span>";
                }
                return out + "</span>";
            }

            function openModal() {
                overlay.classList.add("is-open");
                document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
                if (!loaded && !isLoading) { load(); }
            }
            function closeModal() {
                overlay.classList.remove("is-open");
                document.body.style.overflow = "";
            }

            overlay.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
                if (e.target === overlay) { closeModal(); }
            });
            if (closeX) { closeX.addEventListener("click", closeModal); }
            document.addEventListener("keydown", function (e) {
                if (e.key === "Escape" && overlay.classList.contains("is-open")) { closeModal(); }
            });
            openBtn.addEventListener("click", openModal);

            function load() {
                isLoading = true;
                setHidden(cols, true);
                setHidden(loadEl, false);

                fetch(ENDPOINT, { headers: { "Accept": "application/json" } })
                    .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                    .then(function (d) {
                        isLoading = false;
                        loaded = true;
                        if (!d || !d.ok) { throw new Error("bad payload"); }
                        render(d);
                    })
                    .catch(function () {
                        isLoading = false;
                        setHidden(loadEl, true);
                        setHidden(cols, false);
                        listEl.innerHTML = "";
                        setHidden(distEl, true);
                        avgEl.textContent = "—";
                        cntEl.textContent = "Reviews";
                        emptyEl.textContent = "Could not load the reviews right now — please try again.";
                        setHidden(emptyEl, false);
                        setHidden(writeP, true);
                        setHidden(doneP, true);
                        modal.classList.add("no-write");
                    });
            }

            function render(d) {
                setHidden(loadEl, true);
                setHidden(cols, false);

                var n = d.listing.reviews | 0;
                avgEl.textContent = n > 0 ? Number(d.listing.rating).toFixed(1) : "—";
                cntEl.textContent = n > 0 ? n + (n === 1 ? " review" : " reviews") : "No reviews yet";

                /* distribution bars, 5 → 1 */
                if (n > 0) {
                    var distHtml = "";
                    for (var s = 5; s >= 1; s--) {
                        var c = (d.distribution && d.distribution[s]) | 0;
                        var pct = Math.round((c * 100) / n);
                        distHtml +=
                            '<div class="rd-review-dist-row">' +
                                '<span class="rd-review-bar-label">' + s + ' ★</span>' +
                                '<span class="rd-review-bar"><span style="width:' + pct + '%"></span></span>' +
                                '<span class="rd-review-bar-num">' + c + "</span>" +
                            "</div>";
                    }
                    distEl.innerHTML = distHtml;
                    setHidden(distEl, false);
                } else {
                    distEl.innerHTML = "";
                    setHidden(distEl, true);
                }

                /* review cards */
                if (n > 0 && d.reviews && d.reviews.length) {
                    var cards = "";
                    for (var i = 0; i < d.reviews.length; i++) {
                        var rv = d.reviews[i];
                        cards +=
                            '<div class="rd-review-card">' +
                                '<img class="rd-review-avatar" src="' + esc(rv.avatar) + '" alt="" ' +
                                    'onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=\'/images/default-avatar.png\'">' +
                                '<div>' +
                                    '<div class="rd-review-who">' +
                                        '<span class="rd-review-name">' + esc(rv.name) + "</span>" +
                                        '<span class="rd-review-date">' + esc(rv.date) + "</span>" +
                                    "</div>" +
                                    miniStars(rv.rating | 0) +
                                    (rv.comment ? '<p class="rd-review-text">' + esc(rv.comment) + "</p>" : "") +
                                "</div>" +
                            "</div>";
                    }
                    listEl.innerHTML = cards;
                    setHidden(emptyEl, true);
                } else {
                    listEl.innerHTML = "";
                    emptyEl.textContent = "No reviews yet — be the first to share how it went.";
                    setHidden(emptyEl, false);
                }

                /* keep the ★ chip in sync */
                if (chipTxt) {
                    chipTxt.textContent = n > 0
                        ? Number(d.listing.rating).toFixed(1) + " (" + n + (n === 1 ? " review" : " reviews") + ")"
                        : "Be the first to review";
                }

                /* write panel eligibility */
                setHidden(doneP, true);
                if (d.can_review && d.booking) {
                    bookingId = d.booking.id;
                    modal.classList.remove("no-write");
                    setHidden(writeP, false);
                    var isDone = d.booking.status === "completed";
                    tagEl.textContent = isDone ? "Stay completed" : "Stay cancelled";
                    tagEl.classList.toggle("is-cancelled", !isDone);
                    var span = d.booking.checkin
                        ? d.booking.checkin + (d.booking.checkout ? " – " + d.booking.checkout : "")
                        : "";
                    subEl.textContent =
                        LIST_TITLE + (span ? " · " + span : "") + " · Hosted by " + HOST_NAME;
                    doneTtl.textContent = "Thanks for your review!";
                    doneMsg.textContent = "Your rating is now on this listing and your Reviews page.";
                } else if (d.already_reviewed) {
                    bookingId = 0;
                    modal.classList.remove("no-write");
                    setHidden(writeP, true);
                    setHidden(doneP, false);
                    doneTtl.textContent = "You rated this stay";
                    doneMsg.textContent = "Thanks — your review is on this listing and your Reviews page.";
                } else {
                    bookingId = 0;
                    modal.classList.add("no-write");
                    setHidden(writeP, true);
                }

                /* fresh picker state for this open */
                picked = 0;
                paint(0);
                starLbl.textContent = "Tap a star to rate";
                starLbl.classList.remove("has-value");
                sendBtn.disabled = true;
                setHidden(errEl, true);
                ta.value = "";
            }

            function paint(v) {
                if (!starWrap) return;
                var btns = starWrap.querySelectorAll(".rd-star");
                for (var i = 0; i < btns.length; i++) {
                    var val = Number(btns[i].getAttribute("data-value")) | 0;
                    btns[i].classList.toggle("is-lit", v > 0 && val <= v);
                }
            }

            if (starWrap) {
                starWrap.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
                    var btn = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest(".rd-star") : null;
                    if (!btn) { return; }
                    picked = Number(btn.getAttribute("data-value")) | 0;
                    paint(picked);
                    starLbl.textContent = picked + " out of 5 — " + (LABELS[picked] || "");
                    starLbl.classList.add("has-value");
                    sendBtn.disabled = picked < 1;
                    setHidden(errEl, true);
                });
            }

            if (sendBtn) {
                sendBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    if (busy || picked < 1 || bookingId <= 0) { return; }
                    busy = true;
                    sendBtn.disabled = true;
                    setHidden(errEl, true);

                    var body = "booking_id=" + encodeURIComponent(bookingId) +
                               "&rating=" + encodeURIComponent(picked) +
                               "&comment=" + encodeURIComponent(ta.value);

                    fetch("/reviews/submit", {
                        method: "POST",
                        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" },
                        body: body
                    })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json().then(function (d) { return { status: r.status, d: d }; });
                        })
                        .then(function (res) {
                            busy = false;
                            var d = res.d || {};
                            if (d.success) {
                                setHidden(writeP, true);
                                setHidden(doneP, false);
                                doneTtl.textContent = "Thanks for your review!";
                                doneMsg.textContent = d.message ||
                                    "Your rating is now on this listing and your Reviews page.";
                                /* fresh summary + cards — avg, count,
                                   distribution and the chip all update */
                                loaded = false;
                                load();
                            } else if (res.status === 409) {
                                /* already reviewed (double-click or a stale
                                   box) — refresh so the panels match reality */
                                loaded = false;
                                load();
                            } else {
                                sendBtn.disabled = false;
                                errEl.textContent = d.message || "Could not save your review. Please try again.";
                                setHidden(errEl, false);
                            }
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            busy = false;
                            sendBtn.disabled = false;
                            errEl.textContent = "Network error — please try again.";
                            setHidden(errEl, false);
                        });
                });
            }
        })();
    </script>

    </body>

</html>
